  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency Food Assistance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">New 18 month award contributing 1,100 mt of RUTF in northwest Nigeria (sokoto, katsina, and zamfara) for $5,000,000 in Title ii. This commodity is being supplied to aid in their efforts combating malnutrition in the region, which has increased in severity due to the effects of climate change, violence, and macroeconomic issues in Nigeria.</narrative>
  </description>
